Description: OpenMediaVault fan control for QNAP TS-x39 NAS
 Temperature-driven fan control for older Intel Atom QNAP NAS models
 with an ITE IT8718F Super I/O (e.g. TS-639 Pro), using the in-kernel
 it87 driver. Works on i386 and amd64.
 .
 Status page, dashboard gauges and performance graphs included.
